      "changes": [
        "KFW Task identity, generation and exact directory DTO replace Codex canonical permission/profile types",
        "Per-command native PSEC read domain via fixed MXC, no global read ACL group or AgentCore",
        "The same native binary creates trusted per-command controllers suspended and assigns an outer Job before any user launch DTO is sent",
        "Before MXC wait/teardown the controller proves outer Job ActiveProcesses=1; broker proves ActiveProcesses=0 before physical rangeEmpty",
        "ConPTY allocation/resize/raw input is separate from private inherited IPC handles; controller marks control and query handles non-inheritable before MXC user spawn",
        "Each stdout/stderr raw stream waits for its own ACK; helper UTF8 frame ACK and EOF tail are independent from bounded capture",
        "Pending spawn cancellation, output failure and physical Job termination have separate receipts; unconfirmed range never releases writer",
        "No DACL fallback, permissive learning mode, pipes-as-PTY fallback, or network posture weakening"
      ],
